**URL**：https://www.cambridge.org/core/journals/journal-of-hellenic-studies/article/ring-of-nestor-a-glimpse-into-the-minoan-afterworld-and-a-sepulchral-treasure-of-gold-signetrings-
and-beadseals-from-thisbe-boeotia/5E465BD1031E9251C962E138498E6CFA  
- **发布方/作者**：Sir Arthur Evans; Journal of Hellenic Studies, Cambridge University Press  
- **日期**：原论文 1925 年出版；该在线版本标示 “Published online by Cambridge University Press: 23 December 2013”  
