[tools:16bc1f93-cfee-948e-3b58-6516c19f7427/web_search:8a777ebf-7ddf-d088-9b08-2cd9c659a427] [AIMessage] Below is a curated set of sources relevant to the “Ring of Nestor,” focusing 
on its archaeological/historical context, dating and cultural interpretation, and the scholarly discussion of its name and Homeric associations. I have excluded Wikipedia as a usable 
source (even though it appeared in the search results).

