### Source 4

- **Title:** Burnt animal sacrifice at the Mycenaean “Palace of Nestor”, Pylos  
- **Authors:** Not fully visible in snippet; article hosted or referenced via ResearchGate  
- **URL:** https://www.researchgate.net/publication/276255162_Burnt_animal_sacrifice_at_the_Mycenaean_'Palace_of_Nestor'_Pylos  
- **Publisher / Venue:** Likely an archaeological journal article (exact journal not visible in snippet)  
- **Date:** Not visible, but the theme and ResearchGate indexing suggest 2000s or 2010s  
- **Source type:** Academic article (archaeology, zooarchaeology / rites)  
- **Triggered by query:** `"Ring of Nestor" Pylos Mycenaean`  
- **Relevance:**  
  - Not about the ring itself, but about ritual practice (burnt animal sacrifice) at the Palace of Nestor.  
