'source_ids': ['20260703161206962184_c7b3fb03'], 'kind': 'list_item'}, {'text': '[8] "Pylos of Nestor. A Mycenaean Kingdom Revealed", National Archaeological Museum of Athens. 
Available at: https://www.namuseum.gr/en/temporary_exhibition/pylos-of-nestor-a-mycenaean-kingdom-revealed', 'source_ids': ['20260703161207013830_6036de22'], 'kind': 'list_item'}, 
{'text': '[9] Arthur Evans, "‘The Ring of Nestor’: A Glimpse into the Minoan After-World and A Sepulchral Treasure of Gold Signet-Rings and Bead-Seals from Thisbê, Boeotia", Journal 
