https://www.cambridge.org/core/journals/journal-of-hellenic-studies/article/ring-of-nestor-a-glimpse-into-the-minoan-afterworld-and-a-sepulchral-treasure-of-gold-signetrings-and-beads
eals-from-thisbe-boeotia/5E465BD1031E9251C962E138498E6CFA', 'source_ids': ['20260703161436959810_fbeeb753'], 'kind': 'list_item'}, {'text': '[10] "ʻThe ring of Nestor;̓ a glimpse into
