Ring: A History of Authority Worn on the Hand", Alexandria blog post. URL: https://alexandria.co/blogs/alexandria/signet-ring', 'source_ids': ['20260703161159902493_4a2a7ffc'], 
'kind': 'list_item'}, {'text': '[4] "Deconstructing a Narrative of Epiphany on the Isopata Ring", Journal of Near Eastern Studies article. URL: 
https://www.journals.uchicago.edu/doi/pdfplus/10.2307/507325', 'source_ids': ['20260703161159951369_2cc3a441'], 'kind': 'list_item'}, {'text': '[5] "The Lord of the Gold Rings", study
of the Griffin Warrior grave at Pylos (Academia.edu). URL: https://www.academia.edu/116392582/The_Lord_of_the_Gold_Rings', 'source_ids': ['20260703161206795739_3a735c31'], 'kind': 
