{'text': '[7] "Uncovering the Early Mycenaeans", Popular Archaeology article. URL: https://popular-archaeology.com/article/uncovering-the-early-mycenaeans', 'source_ids': 
['20260703161206962184_c7b3fb03'], 'kind': 'list_item'}, {'text': '[8] "Pylos of Nestor. A Mycenaean Kingdom Revealed", National Archaeological Museum of Athens exhibition page. URL: 
https://www.namuseum.gr/en/temporary_exhibition/pylos-of-nestor-a-mycenaean-kingdom-revealed', 'source_ids': ['20260703161207013830_6036de22'], 'kind': 'list_item'}, {'text': '[9] 
Arthur Evans, "‘The Ring of Nestor’: A Glimpse into the Minoan After-World and A Sepulchral Treasure of Gold Signet-Rings and Bead-Seals from Thisbê, Boeotia", Journal of Hellenic 
